WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.301 --> 00:00:02.569
-Good evening,
I'm Seth Meyers, everybody.

00:00:02.569 --> 00:00:04.003
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:04.003 --> 00:00:06.272
And now, if you don't mind,
we are gonna get to the news.

00:00:06.272 --> 00:00:09.075
President Biden visited
the Pentagon on Sunday

00:00:09.075 --> 00:00:12.478
to commemorate the anniversary
of the September 11th attack

00:00:12.478 --> 00:00:15.148
and said, "It's not enough
to stand up

00:00:15.148 --> 00:00:16.749
for democracy once a year."

00:00:16.749 --> 00:00:20.220
"I don't know, I'm making it
work," said Joe Manchin.

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:22.221
[ Laughter ]

00:00:22.221 --> 00:00:24.156
White House officials
are reportedly holding

00:00:24.156 --> 00:00:26.793
emergency meetings to prevent
a potential national

00:00:26.793 --> 00:00:29.395
railroad strike,
but just in case,

00:00:29.395 --> 00:00:30.864
Biden's ready if you need him.

00:00:30.864 --> 00:00:33.265
[ Laughter ]

00:00:33.265 --> 00:00:35.801
President Biden spoke
about his infrastructure plan

00:00:35.801 --> 00:00:37.136
yesterday in Boston.

00:00:37.136 --> 00:00:40.806
Said one Boston resident,
"Wow, I've never gotten a DUI

00:00:40.806 --> 00:00:42.575
on a paved road before."

00:00:42.575 --> 00:00:44.411
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.746 --> 00:00:48.781
We could have given him a shirt.

00:00:48.781 --> 00:00:50.883
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.883 --> 00:00:53.219
According to the latest numbers
from the Bureau of Labor

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:55.288
statistics, gas prices
have decreased

00:00:55.288 --> 00:00:58.658 line:0%
for 89 consecutive days,
or as Fox News reported it,

00:00:58.658 --> 00:01:01.194 line:0%
"Biden leaves oil markets
in shambles."

00:01:01.194 --> 00:01:03.262 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.262 --> 00:01:05.431
Buckingham palace will
reportedly only extend

00:01:05.431 --> 00:01:07.800
invites to Queen Elizabeth's
funeral to current

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:10.470
heads of state,
and no former presidents,

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:13.373
which is a bummer 'cause we all
kind of wanted to hear

00:01:13.373 --> 00:01:14.574
that eulogy.

00:01:14.574 --> 00:01:18.144
"Elizabeth, she loved
everyone at Hogwarts."

00:01:18.144 --> 00:01:19.679
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.679 --> 00:01:22.348
"Even the gingers,
even the gingers."

00:01:22.348 --> 00:01:24.117
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.117 --> 00:01:26.953
"And if she were here,
I -- I know what she would say.

00:01:26.953 --> 00:01:29.355
She would say January 6th
was mostly Antifa."

00:01:29.355 --> 00:01:32.358
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.358 --> 00:01:35.494
Apple yesterday released
its IOS 16 software,

00:01:35.494 --> 00:01:39.131
which will allow iPhone users
to unsend messages,

00:01:39.131 --> 00:01:41.267
and not a moment too soon.

00:01:41.267 --> 00:01:43.303
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:50.609
The Emmy Awards ceremony
was held last night.

00:01:50.609 --> 00:01:52.745
Our show was nominated
and, honey,

00:01:52.745 --> 00:01:54.814
clear some space on the mantle,

00:01:54.814 --> 00:01:57.450
cause they had snow globes
at the airport.

00:01:57.450 --> 00:02:00.152
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.152 --> 00:02:02.255
[ Audience "awws" ]

00:02:02.255 --> 00:02:04.190
[ Applause ]

00:02:09.262 --> 00:02:11.564
Elon Musk's college girlfriend
is auctioning off

00:02:11.564 --> 00:02:13.432
personal items
from their relationship,

00:02:13.432 --> 00:02:15.534
including photographs,
a birthday card

00:02:15.534 --> 00:02:17.570
and upwards of three kids.

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:19.505
[ Laughter ]

00:02:19.505 --> 00:02:21.941
[ Audience "ohs" ]

00:02:21.941 --> 00:02:24.544
That's why we win
the snow globes, baby.

00:02:24.544 --> 00:02:26.546
[ Laughter ]

00:02:32.051 --> 00:02:34.086
Princeton University
announced last week

00:02:34.086 --> 00:02:36.889
it will cover all costs
for undergraduate students

00:02:36.889 --> 00:02:40.026
for families making
less than $100,000 a year.

00:02:40.026 --> 00:02:42.361
Said school officials,
"It's not their fault

00:02:42.361 --> 00:02:44.263
their parents went to Brown."

00:02:44.263 --> 00:02:48.567
[ Audience "ohs" ]

00:02:48.567 --> 00:02:51.437
That's the sort of cutting
ivy league humor...

00:02:51.437 --> 00:02:54.106
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.106 --> 00:02:57.777
And finally, according to a new
survey, 26% of Americans

00:02:57.777 --> 00:02:59.746
said that if they were
reading a book

00:02:59.746 --> 00:03:02.248
and not enjoying it,
they would still finish it.

00:03:02.248 --> 00:03:04.717
"Thank you," said Dan Brown.

00:03:04.717 --> 00:03:06.085
[ Laughter ]

00:03:06.085 --> 00:03:07.887
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

00:03:07.887 --> 00:03:10.557
We are off and running.

